message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "You **cannot** directly attach Think mode to an Agent in the **Chat** tab and share it organization-wide to enable step-by-step reasoning for all teammates in every chat session. Here’s why and what the alternatives are:\n\n### Key Constraints\n1. **Think mode is a per-session toggle**, not a persistent Agent feature. It must be manually enabled in each chat session by selecting the `Think` mode in the chat window [1].\n   - It does not persist across chats or Agents.\n   - It is not configurable as part of an Agent’s instructions or tools.\n\n2. **Agents are reusable assistants**, but they do not inherit Think mode as a built-in capability. An Agent can only execute its predefined instructions/tools, not toggle Think mode automatically [3].\n\n3. **Sharing an Agent does not propagate Think mode**. Even if you could configure Think mode in an Agent (which you cannot), sharing the Agent via `Entire organization` would only replicate the Agent’s instructions/tools—not the Think mode toggle [4].\n\n### How Features Combine (Workaround)\nIf your goal is to provide step-by-step reasoning for multi-factor decisions **organization-wide**, consider these alternatives:\n\n1. **Use Vibe Work (recommended)**:\n   - Work automatically enables step-by-step reasoning when the task requires it (no manual toggle needed) [1][6].\n   - You can create **Skills** (Work’s equivalent of Agents) with predefined reasoning logic and share them organization-wide [5].\n   - Example: A Skill configured for `multi-factor decision analysis` would trigger reasoning automatically when invoked.\n\n2. **Train teammates to use Think mode manually** in Chat:\n   - Share a guide on how to enable Think mode in the Chat tab [1].\n   - This requires manual effort per session and does not scale via Agents.\n\n3. **Combine Agents with related features** (e.g., Code Interpreter for quantitative reasoning or Files/Canvas for iterative refinement) [2], but these do not replace Think mode’s explicit step-by-step logic.\n\n### Limits\n- Think mode is **not configurable** as part of an Agent’s setup or shareable as a persistent feature [1][3].\n- Agents in Chat **do not support automatic reasoning toggles** [3].\n- Work is the future-proof solution for organization-wide step-by-step reasoning [5][6].",
